flowchart TD
    API[FastAPI API] --> Dialer[Dialer orchestration]
    Dialer --> Pacing[Pacing Engine]
    Pacing --> Safety[Safety Controller]
    Safety --> Allocator[Allocator]
    Allocator <--> DB[(Relational database)]
    Allocator --> Provider[Provider interface]
    Provider --> A[Mock Provider A]
    Provider --> B[Mock Provider B]
    A --> EventAPI[Provider event API]
    B --> EventAPI
    EventAPI --> Handler[Provider event handler]
    Handler <--> DB
    API --> Recovery[Stale reservation recovery]
    Recovery <--> DB
